WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.250
Aquila looked fierce but his eyes were kind.

2
00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:15.224
"Septimus told me of your help," he said.

3
00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:18.674
"My victory will be in your honor."

4
00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:23.019
"Aquila!" Another man came over to them.

5
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.066
His smile wasn't kind.

6
00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:29.334
"How are your horses?" he said.

7
00:00:29.335 --> 00:00:31.687
Aquila smiled too.

8
00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:34.047
"They are ready to race, Brutus.

9
00:00:34.048 --> 00:00:37.475
Melus brought them fresh water from his well."

10
00:00:37.476 --> 00:00:40.302
Brutus' face grew red.

11
00:00:40.303 --> 00:00:42.607
"What about the water I sent?"

12
00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:52.010
"It was unfortunate," Aquila said coldly, "but Melus accidentally spilled it on the stable floor."

13
00:00:52.011 --> 00:00:55.884
Brutus moved angrily toward Aquila.

14
00:00:55.885 --> 00:00:59.078
The two men seemed ready to fight.

15
00:00:59.079 --> 00:01:00.957
"Take your places!

16
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:03.463
The race is about to begin!"

17
00:01:03.464 --> 00:01:07.782
cried Master Antonius, stepping between the men.

18
00:01:07.783 --> 00:01:11.223
Varius held Aquila back too.

19
00:01:11.224 --> 00:01:13.786
"I will have my revenge,"

20
00:01:13.787 --> 00:01:16.938
said Brutus, walking away.

21
00:01:16.939 --> 00:01:22.012
"Enjoy the race, children," said Aquila, and left.

22
00:01:22.013 --> 00:01:26.223
"Are you okay?" Varius said to the children.

23
00:01:26.224 --> 00:01:29.611
Vinnie and Mandy nodded nervously.

24
00:01:29.612 --> 00:01:35.540
They all found seats and watched Master Antonius walk onto the stage.

25
00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:40.011
He raised his arms and the audience grew quiet.

26
00:01:40.012 --> 00:01:43.342
"Are you ready to start the race?"

27
00:01:43.343 --> 00:01:46.128
he asked the huge crowd.

28
00:01:46.129 --> 00:01:51.112
The people cheered wildly.

29
00:01:51.113 --> 00:01:57.000
Master Antonius pointed to the twelve gates at the end of the arena.

30
00:01:57.001 --> 00:02:03.603
Suddenly a horn blew loudly, and Antonius dropped a white cloth.

31
00:02:03.604 --> 00:02:08.616
The gates opened and the chariots came speeding out.

32
00:02:08.617 --> 00:02:14.093
"There's Aquila!" said Varius, pointing to a golden chariot.

33
00:02:14.094 --> 00:02:19.605
Aquila lashed his horses as he raced around the track.

34
00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:23.480
"And Brutus!" yelled Vinnie.

35
00:02:23.481 --> 00:02:26.880
Brutus was close behind Aquila.

36
00:02:26.881 --> 00:02:30.256
His chariot was red and green.

37
00:02:30.257 --> 00:02:34.983
It had a spike sticking out from the middle of each wheel.

38
00:02:34.984 --> 00:02:38.632
They raced once around the track.

39
00:02:38.633 --> 00:02:42.273
Men on the stage turned one dolphin up.

40
00:02:42.274 --> 00:02:45.357
Mandy noticed it right away.

41
00:02:45.358 --> 00:02:48.879
"One lap!" she yelled.

42
00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:52.882
"Go, Aquila!" Vinnie was yelling.

43
00:02:52.883 --> 00:02:57.801
"Vinnie! Let me see the photo!" Mandy shouted.

44
00:02:57.802 --> 00:03:00.210
He handed her the photo.

45
00:03:00.211 --> 00:03:04.761
"We're getting closer to home!" she said.

46
00:03:04.762 --> 00:03:08.742
"Aquila! Watch out!" cried Vinnie.

47
00:03:08.743 --> 00:03:13.202
Brutus was trying to crash into Aquila's chariot.

48
00:03:13.203 --> 00:03:20.288
"If Brutus' spike hits Aquila's wheel, Aquila's chariot could flip over," said Varius.

49
00:03:20.289 --> 00:03:24.408
"Then Aquila will be crushed under the horses' feet!"

50
00:03:24.409 --> 00:03:27.071
"Oh, I can't look!"

51
00:03:27.072 --> 00:03:30.005
Mandy covered her eyes.

52
00:03:30.006 --> 00:03:33.414
Aquila moved away just in time.

53
00:03:33.415 --> 00:03:39.831
Another dolphin was flipped to show a second lap was completed.

54
00:03:39.832 --> 00:03:45.012
"Varius!" Mandy touched his arm. "Thank you!"

55
00:03:45.013 --> 00:03:51.000
The two dolphins in the photo were glowing red as Aquila pulled ahead.

56
00:03:51.001 --> 00:03:55.416
Vinnie was cheering loudly.

57
00:03:55.417 --> 00:03:58.226
Mandy grabbed Vinnie's hand.

58
00:03:58.227 --> 00:04:03.014
"Go, Aqu . . . " Vinnie began to shout.

59
00:04:03.015 --> 00:04:09.994
Then the children fell down the dark tunnel.
